cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
xlsx.1	1	conversion	sheets					each worksheet is one sheet named as the worksheet, each cell's value its text, each type left behind named by its cell's reference and t
xlsx.2	1	conversion	sheets	failed	cannot be represented			a cell's text MTSV cannot hold ends the load as cannot be represented, the conversion failed
xlsx.3	1	conversion	sheets	failed	failed			a workbook whose part a relationship it reads names is not among its nodes ends the load as failed, the conversion failed
